---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cancellation Policy | Fish The Wahoo"
  description="Fish The Wahoo cancellation and refund policy for Charleston deep sea fishing charter bookings."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-nautical-dark">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="section-label">Policies</span>
      <h1 class="text-5xl text-white uppercase mb-6">Cancellation Policy</h1>
      <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-accent-orange mb-12"></div>

      <div class="prose-dark space-y-8 text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <div class="metallic-card rounded-xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white uppercase mb-4">Customer Cancellations</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-3 list-disc list-inside marker:text-accent-orange">
            <li>Cancellations made <span class="text-white">more than 30 days</span> before departure receive a full refund of the deposit.</li>
            <li>Cancellations made <span class="text-white">7 to 30 days</span> before departure forfeit the deposit.</li>
            <li>Cancellations made <span class="text-white">inside 7 days</span> of departure are responsible for the full charter payment.</li>
            <li>Once the client is on the boat and the boat leaves the dock, no client is entitled to any discount or refund for any reason.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-6 text-slate-400">All cancellations must be submitted in writing to <a href="mailto:chuck141w@yahoo.com" class="text-accent-orange hover:underline">chuck141w@yahoo.com</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="metallic-card rounded-xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white uppercase mb-4">Weather Cancellations</h2>
          <p>If we cancel your trip due to unsafe weather conditions, you'll receive a full refund of your deposit or the option to reschedule at no additional charge. We'll notify you at least 24 hours in advance when possible.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400">Note: we do not cancel for rain alone. We cancel when conditions are unsafe for offshore operations (high seas, lightning, etc.).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="metallic-card rounded-xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white uppercase mb-4">What We Do And Don't Guarantee</h2>
          <p>Fish The Wahoo cannot warrant or guarantee, in any way: (1) that any particular feature or system of any boat will be in working order, (2) the overall condition of any vessel, (3) that any particular kind of fishing will be attempted — trolling, bottom fishing, etc. — as the captain decides based on circumstances, or (4) that any particular species will be caught or targeted.</p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-8">By completing a booking, you indicate you have read and agree to these terms. Contact us with any questions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
